:: Alex Gift Strap-on
<<set $location to "alex_cottage">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>

<<set _toy to "strap-on">>
You place the <<= _toy>> on Alex's desk. <<He>> swivels in <<his>> chair to face you, nearly dropping the phone in surprise when <<he>> spots it. <<He>> clears <<his>> throat and turns away from the receiver. "P-please hold."
<br><br>

Setting the phone down, <<he>> grabs the <<= _toy>> and gives it an openly appreciative once-over.
<<giftSexToys "Alex">>
<<if C.npc.Alex.dom gte 30>>
	<<He>> whistles. "Nice choice." <<He>> pauses, flashing you a smirk. "For a newbie, anyway."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> gets up from <<his>> desk, smacking your <<bottom>> with the <<= _toy>> as <<he>> passes. "Hope you know what you're getting into," <<he>> whispers. "You're in for a wild ride, cow<<girl>>."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> places it in a drawer near <<his>> bed before returning back to work, whistling a tune.
<<elseif C.npc.Alex.dom lte -30>>
	<<He>> scratches <<his>> head sheepishly. "You've got some wild ideas." <<He>> stares at the <<= _toy>> for a long beat, then lets out a quiet, helpless chuckle.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> rises from the desk with a sigh. "Hell, if you think it's a good idea, you're probably right."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> places it in a drawer near <<his>> bed before returning to work, blushing.
<<else>>
	"You've got some wild ideas, y'know." <<He>> licks <<his>> lips. "I like 'em."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> rises from <<his>> desk, bopping you on the head with the <<= _toy>> as <<he>> passes. "Hope you know how to ride, cow<<girl>>."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> places it in a drawer near <<his>> bed before returning to work, grinning.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Eden Gift Strap-on
<<set $location to "cabin">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<set _sextoy to "strap-on">>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"Eden?" You hold the <<= _sextoy>> out with both hands. "I was hoping you could... use this." Your gaze drops to the floor. "O-on me."
	<<case "docile">>
		You present the <<= _sextoy>> carefully. "If you wanted to use this on me sometime, I'd let you," you murmur. "I think I'd like that."
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		You set the <<= _sextoy>> on the table beside Eden. "I thought we might try something a little different sometime," you say. "Only if it appeals to you, of course."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"Hey." You toss the <<= _sextoy>> into <<his>> lap. "We're trying that out later. Got it?"
	<<case "cruel">>
		You drop the <<= _sextoy>> in front of Eden with a flat look. "You're using that on me sooner or later. Don't make me explain why it'd suit you."
	<<case "special">>
		You set the <<= _sextoy>> down where Eden can't miss it. "I brought you a present," you say, smiling faintly. "And yes, I want to feel exactly what you'd do with it."
	<<default>>
		You set the <<= _sextoy>> on the table beside Eden. "I thought we could try something new. How about it?"
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<He>> snatches the <<= _sextoy>> up with a furrowed brow, turning it over in <<his>> hands as if weighing the idea along with the toy. <<He>> shakes <<his>> head. "Waste of time," <<he>> grunts. "What would I even get out of it?"
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Eden.love gte 100>>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek" "shy">>
			You drop to your knees beside Eden's chair, wrapping your arms around <<his>> bicep and propping your cheek against <<his>> shoulder.
			"Please?" you beg, looking up through your lashes. "I've been good, haven't I...?"
		<<case "docile">>
			You settle close against Eden's side and rest a careful hand on <<his>> arm.
			"Please," you say softly. "I want you to do it. I'd be good for you."
		<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
			You sit on the arm of the chair and drape your arms around Eden's shoulders, smiling as you draw <<him>> in.
			"Come on... It would make me very happy. Indulge me?"
		<<case "bratty" "confident">>
			Without warning, you swing yourself into Eden's lap and plant your hands on <<his>> shoulders. <<His>> expression barely shifts.
			"Know what I think?" you whisper at <<his>> ear. "I think you're scared you couldn't handle me."
		<<case "cruel">>
			You lean over the chair and hook two fingers beneath Eden's chin, forcing <<him>> to meet your eyes.
			"You'd get plenty out of it. A better look at what I'm like when you stop pretending you're not curious."
		<<case "special">>
			You climb onto the arm of the chair and lean into Eden's space until <<he>> has no choice but to look at you.
			"Come on. You know you want to hear how I'd sound."
		<<default>>
			You sit on the arm of the chair, wrapping your arms around Eden's shoulders and pulling <<him>> against you.
			"Come on," you say, giving <<his>> arm a light squeeze. "It'd make me happy."
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	Eden stares at you, unflinching. Finally, <<he>> sighs through <<his>> nose. "Fine. But if I don't like it, that's it." <<He>> glances back at the <<= _sextoy>> and snorts. "Might still be worth it to hear you squeal."
	<<giftSexToys "Eden">>
<<else>>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek" "shy">>
			"Please? You—"
		<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
			"Just hear me out for a—"
		<<case "bratty" "confident">>
			"Oh, come on, just—"
		<<case "cruel">>
			"Don't be difficult, just—"
		<<case "special">>
			"You could at least pretend to—"
		<<default>>
			"Just give it—"
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	"No," Eden interrupts, voice flat and final. <<He>> looks up from <<his>> book with a glare. "When you start taking care of things around here, you can call the shots. Until then, we do what I want. And that's that."
	<br><br>

	<span class="purple">If <<he>> liked you more <<he>> might be amenable to your request.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Eden Cabin]]>><</link>>


:: Gift Strap-on Sydney Counter
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<speechresolve>>

