<<set _sextoy to "strap-on">>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		You place the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter with studied care, as though being gentle with it might make the conversation easier.
	<<case "docile">>
		You slide the <<= _sextoy>> across the counter toward Sydney and fold your hands in front of you, waiting for <<him>> to notice.
